                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Andreas Dilger &amp;lt;adilger@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/24fe42f3-5042-435b-a164-5a5d6885874e" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/24fe42f3-5042-435b-a164-5a5d6885874e&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_70f failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;dd oflag=direct bs=1M count=10 if=/tmp/f70f.replay-single  of=/mnt/lustre/d70f.replay-single/f70f.replay-single.onyx-134vm5 failed on onyx-134vm5, rc=1
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/106717" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/106717&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-513.24.1.el8_9.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/106717" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/106717&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-513.24.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Nothing obvious in the console logs, and has been failing very intermittently for a few months.  It isn't clear how the "dd" failed (no output), so it seems possible that the "dd" completed successfully and the check for this process failed instead?&lt;/p&gt;







